  "locales": {
    "en": {
      "trackName": "Place Guesser: World Map Quiz",
      "description": "You are dropped somewhere in the world in and you have to find clues and guess your location on the world map.\n\nEmbark on a thrilling global adventure with our immersive travel game!\n\nExplore the world like never before with our two exciting game modes: Quick Play and Country Streak.\nIn Quick Play, test your observation skills and race against the clock to guess your location based on captivating 360° panorama look around view images.\n\nWant to challenge your geographical knowledge even further?\nDive into Country Streak and guess the correct country based on stunning street view scenes. \nImmerse yourself in breathtaking landscapes, iconic landmarks, and vibrant city streets from around the world. Whether you're a casual explorer or a seasoned globetrotter, our app will keep you hooked with its addictive gameplay and captivating visuals.\n\nReady to become a world-class explorer? Download our app now and embark on a thrilling journey of discovery!\n\n------------------------------------------------------------\n\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.mobivalley.com.br/privacypolicy",
      "releaseNotes": "Bug fixes and performance improvements. New locations coming soon!",
