      "version": "1.41.0",
      "releaseNotes": "We’re expanding and improving!\n– New countries added: Say hello to Bulgaria, Montenegro, Albania, Serbia, Slovakia, and Ukraine — now fully supported!\n– Fresh new look: Updated app icon for iOS 26 to match the latest style.\n– UI enhancements: Smoother navigation, cleaner layout, and overall improved user experience.\n\nUpdate now to explore more, faster, and better!",
