    },
    {
      "version": "1.42.0",
      "releaseNotes": "We’ve added support for:\n\nBotswana, Cayman Islands, Costa Rica, Cyprus, El Salvador, Estonia, Kazakhstan, Kyrgyzstan, Lebanon, Malta, Namibia, Oman, Romania\n\nUpdate now to access all the new locations and enjoy an expanded premium experience!",
