    },
    {
      "version": "1.44.0",
      "releaseNotes": "We’ve expanded your adventure! Discover several brand-new places among the world’s best tourist attractions.\nPlus, we’ve added 4 exciting new leaderboards: Basic and Pro for both Quick Game and Country Streak, so you can compete weekly and see how you rank against players worldwide. Explore, play, and climb the global rankings!",
      "seenAt": "2025-11-23T00:02:04Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.45.0",
      "releaseNotes": "This update brings an exciting new way to explore the world—right from your Apple Watch!\nWe’ve added a brand-new Street View game on watchOS, letting you jump into immersive panoramas and guess locations on the go. Whether you're traveling, taking a break, or just curious, it’s a fun and intuitive way to test your geography skills and discover new places.\n\nMore improvements and refinements are included to keep your experience smooth and enjoyable.\n\nEnjoy exploring!",
      "seenAt": "2025-12-08T02:46:56Z"
